        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The technology in this dataset represents standard incineration technology in Europe.\n\n# Included processes\nThe dataset describes the disposal of a wood-aluminium outer door in a municipal incineration. The door frame out of steel is recycled at 100%. The rest of the materials (rest of steel parts, aluminium, rubber, plastics, mortar, paints and wood) is disposed in a municipal solid waste incineration.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
